msgid "Xiaomi Control"
msgstr "小米控制"

msgid "RF mode"
msgstr "射频切换"

msgid "5 GHz radio mode"
msgstr "5 GHz 射频模式"

msgid "Dual-band: 2.4G 4x4 + 5G 4x4 (full band)"
msgstr "双频：2.4G 4x4 + 5G 4x4（全频段）"

msgid "Tri-band: 2.4G 4x4 + 5.2G 2x2 + 5.8G 2x2"
msgstr "三频：2.4G 4x4 + 5.2G 2x2 + 5.8G 2x2"

msgid "Switch between a single 5 GHz 4x4 radio (full band) and two 5 GHz 2x2 radios (5.2G + 5.8G). Changing the mode requires a reboot."
msgstr "在单个 5 GHz 4x4 射频（全频段）与两个 5 GHz 2x2 射频（5.2G + 5.8G）之间切换。切换模式需要重启。"

msgid "Apply mode"
msgstr "应用模式"

msgid "Tri-band"
msgstr "三频"

msgid "Dual-band"
msgstr "双频"

msgid "After switching: the 5G 4x4 radio is split into two independent 2x2 radios (5.2G + 5.8G)."
msgstr "切换后：5G 4x4 射频将拆分为两个独立的 2x2 射频（5.2G + 5.8G）。"

msgid "After switching: restore a single 5G 4x4 radio covering the full band (160 MHz)."
msgstr "切换后：恢复为覆盖全频段（160 MHz）的单个 5G 4x4 射频。"

msgid "SSIDs after switch: %s"
msgstr "切换后的 SSID：%s"

msgid "Current: %s"
msgstr "当前：%s"

msgid "Current: %s | Selected: %s | effective after reboot"
msgstr "当前：%s | 已选：%s | 重启后生效"

msgid "RF mode control is only available on the Xiaomi BE7000."
msgstr "射频切换仅在小米 BE7000 上可用。"

msgid "Error: %s"
msgstr "错误：%s"

msgid "Saving..."
msgstr "正在保存..."

msgid "Save and reboot"
msgstr "保存并重启"

msgid "Rebooting..."
msgstr "正在重启..."

msgid "Waiting for the device to come back..."
msgstr "正在等待设备重新上线..."

msgid "Switching reboots the router. Save your work first."
msgstr "切换将重启路由器，请先保存好当前工作。"

msgid "A new 5.8G SSID is added (channel 149 / 80 MHz), while your existing 2.4G and 5G names stay unchanged."
msgstr "将新增一个 5.8G 名称（信道 149 / 80 MHz），你现有的 2.4G 和 5G 名称保持不变。"

msgid "Password and encryption of the new 5.8G are inherited from the primary 5G."
msgstr "新增 5.8G 的密码和加密方式沿用自主 5G。"

msgid "Single-client peak and coverage drop; multi-client concurrency and a dedicated backhaul improve."
msgstr "单设备峰值速率和覆盖范围下降；多设备并发与专用回程能力提升。"

msgid "The 5.8G entry is removed from the wireless page; all your SSIDs stay unchanged."
msgstr "5.8G 条目将从无线页面移除；你的所有名称保持不变。"

msgid "The 5.8G name is remembered, so it returns when you switch back to tri-band."
msgstr "5.8G 名称会被记住，切回三频时会恢复。"
